    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheer up, Omaena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/00cd0075522958612a5b83d1ca7b9876.poster.avif?t=1731920191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/00cd0075522958612a5b83d1ca7b9876.webm?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/00cd0075522958612a5b83d1ca7b9876.mp4?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Omaena Jumping Carnival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/40f136731dfe2d29028b00f28efef68f.poster.avif?t=1731920191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/40f136731dfe2d29028b00f28efef68f.webm?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/40f136731dfe2d29028b00f28efef68f.mp4?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omaena VS Zombie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/a18dc91638c2f1a053267e6cd11fefb9.poster.avif?t=1731920191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/a18dc91638c2f1a053267e6cd11fefb9.webm?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/a18dc91638c2f1a053267e6cd11fefb9.mp4?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Casual VR experience with characters set in the charming city with Gwangju&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting, Catching, and Speed Actions 3 games mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing for motion sickness from the start to make the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an immersive experience through VR, requiring physical activity, concentration, and indirectly experiencing the sights of Gwangju City through the game.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheer up, Omaena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/00cd0075522958612a5b83d1ca7b9876.poster.avif?t=1731920191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/00cd0075522958612a5b83d1ca7b9876.webm?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/00cd0075522958612a5b83d1ca7b9876.mp4?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Omaena Jumping Carnival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/40f136731dfe2d29028b00f28efef68f.poster.avif?t=1731920191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/40f136731dfe2d29028b00f28efef68f.webm?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/40f136731dfe2d29028b00f28efef68f.mp4?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Omaena VS Zombie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/a18dc91638c2f1a053267e6cd11fefb9.poster.avif?t=1731920191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/a18dc91638c2f1a053267e6cd11fefb9.webm?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280410/extras/a18dc91638c2f1a053267e6cd11fefb9.mp4?t=1731920191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Casual VR experience with characters set in the charming city with Gwangju&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting, Catching, and Speed Actions 3 games mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing for motion sickness from the start to make the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an immersive experience through VR, requiring physical activity, concentration, and indirectly experiencing the sights of Gwangju City through the game.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "VR Gwangju Tour with Omaena is an exciting virtual reality game that lets you explore Gwangju's famous landmarks with Omaena, the city's lovable mascot. This single-player tourism experience features three fun VR casual games. It's perfect for all ages, especially kids. Come and enjoy adventures!",
